Package: FedGEE
Type: Package
Title: Federated Generalized Estimating Equations
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Soumik", "Purkayastha", email = "soumik@pitt.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Fits generalized estimating equations across sites that share
    only p x p summary matrices, either through a central server or over a
    serverless gossip network. Provides score-space small-sample variance
    corrections (Kauermann-Carroll, Mancl-DeRouen, Fay-Graubard) and
    Bell-McCaffrey degrees of freedom computed from site summaries alone.
